        "heading": "<p>Built to <strong>Work.</strong></p>",
        "body": "<p>At Northern Gym Equipment, Built to Work is more than a slogan. It's the standard we hold ourselves to.</p><p>It defines how we build our products, support our customers, and run our business. We believe there are no shortcuts, in fitness or in life. Progress comes from consistency, attention to detail, and showing up every day.</p><p>That's why every product we create is built to withstand real training. Whether you're investing in home gym equipment, outfitting a commercial facility, or adding to your strength setup, our equipment is designed to perform session after session, year after year.</p>",
