            "kicker": "When it all comes down to it, nothing outworks hard work.",
            "body": "<p>We believe results come from showing up and putting in the effort. That's why we work hard to deliver quality products, honest advice, and dependable service, so our customers can focus on doing the work. No piece of equipment can do the work for you, but the right equipment should help you do your best work.</p>"
